# SO-101 run sheet. E157: Terse vs detailed goal.
# Run from the root of this checkout, against the arm registered as arm-01:
#   quackd run docs/examples/lerobot/e157/detailed.duck --robot arm-01 --camera-url "opencv://1?name=front" --llm openai:gpt-6-sol --max-steps 10 --no-memory --run-name trial-1
# The run sheet has all 3 runs of this file, one per --run-name.
---
duck: 1
name: e157-detailed
description: "The detailed goal."
author: rok
requires: [move_joints]
verbs:
  allow: [report_state, move_joints, gripper, place, stop]
  confirm: []
budgets:
  max_steps: 10
  max_minutes: 5
  max_llm_calls: 24
success:
  - "You have done what the task asks, as best you can tell from your joints and any camera pictures, or said plainly why this body cannot."
abort_when:
  - Same verb fails 3 times in a row
persona: "Practical and honest: say so when you cannot do something."
---

# Task

Please wave to the camera. Lift your forearm until elbow_flex is about 0, so it points up, and straighten your wrist to wrist_flex 0 in the same move, then roll your wrist about 27 degrees either side of neutral three times, then return to neutral.
